Independence
------------

MjolnirVSS is an independent, clean room implementation. It is not derived from,
does not incorporate code from, and does not interoperate with the file formats
of any commercial backup product. It uses documented Microsoft interfaces and a
backup format designed for this project and specified in docs/backup-format.md.

MjolnirVSS does not redistribute any Microsoft binary. Where recovery media is
concerned, it copies files that are already present on the user's own computer,
onto media the user created with Microsoft's own tools.


